# SHA-256 digests of every /etc/plymouth/plymouthd.conf that Luma's desktop
# composition has shipped before the current config/boot/plymouthd.conf. A
# machine whose file matches one of these still has Luma's own setting, not an
# administrator's, and luma-boot-splash-migrate moves it to the current one.
# Append the outgoing digest here whenever config/boot/plymouthd.conf changes;
# never remove a line.
